    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/minimalistic-portfolio/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Minimalistic Portfolio is a clean and modern WordPress theme crafted for creatives, freelancers, and agencies aiming to showcase their work with clarity and style. With a focus on a minimal aesthetic, it emphasizes strong typography, spacious layouts, and a smooth user experience to effectively highlight both personal and creative portfolios. This theme features well-organized sections, including a bold hero banner, services overview, key features, and testimonials, all designed to enhance your artistic presentation. It supports various portfolio galleries, team introductions, and blog integration, making it a versatile design showcase. Additionally, the responsive design ensures fast loading performance, while easy customization options allow you to quickly create a professional photography portfolio or metro portfolio without any coding experience. Overall, Minimalistic Portfolio is perfect for designers, developers, photographers, and startups seeking to establish a strong online presence with its sleek, fullscreen, and split screen layout options."
    },
